// Historical PTO-DSL matmul optimization guide step 3, generated from
// huawei-csl/pto-dsl@36cd417e230a84a80870f564de27539ccc7c4a75 with the
// 20260305 PTOAS frontend, then memory-planned. The raw generated PTO has
// SHA256 3db5d353475ee920857d16e5c3533ab23e0c6d2c38e22b57235c0e85a9a6a380;
